retch and strong pause at the top."},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}],"note":"Keep elbows fixed."}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}],"note":"Controlled depth; do not let hips roll off the pad."},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}],"note":"Low-to-moderate incline."},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Use the mid-row machine; pause at peak contraction."},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":2}],"note":"One of the few RDL appearances; feel hamstrings, not lower back."},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":2}],"note":"Smooth reps; no snapping into lockout."},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}],"note":"Keep upper arms steady."}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}],"note":"Add load only if Week 1 was comfortably within target RPE."},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Use the converging chest press."},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Close Grip)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Neutral/close grip if available."},{"n":"Reverse Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":2}],"note":"Step back far enough to stay stable."},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}],"note":"Controlled eccentric."},{"n":"Concentration Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}],"note":"Strict single-arm reps."}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}],"note":"Conventional stance; leave 2-3 clean reps in reserve."},{"n":"Landmine Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}],"note":"Single-arm standing press using the hinged bar."},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Keep torso angle consistent."},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"n